3dfetch (0.5.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Full-width --nggyu artwork, played at the speed of the original.
  * The info drops below the picture on narrow terminals instead of
    squeezing it.
  * Homebrew, AUR, RPM, Debian and Nix packaging all point at this
    repository now.

